# PHP 5.4

Target **PHP 5.4** (Docker + hallaweb). Host PHP 8 lint is not enough. Prefer shims in `_includes/compat.php` (loaded from bootstrap). Short `[]` is OK.

| Avoid | Use |
|-------|-----|
| Scalar/return types | Untyped params/returns |
| `$a ?? $b` | `isset($a) ? $a : $b` |
| `fn($x) => …` | `function ($x) { return …; }` |
| `catch (Throwable` | `catch (Exception` |
| `DateTimeImmutable` | `DateTime` |
| `...$rows` unpack | `foreach` / `array_merge` |
| `[$a, $b] = …` | `list($a, $b) = …` |
| `intdiv`, `array_column` | `(int) ($a / $b)`, `foreach` |

`str_starts_with` / `str_ends_with` / `str_contains` / `array_key_*` only via `compat.php`. Experiment apps do not load bootstrap — do not call those helpers there.

Nowdoc closer is `HTML` or `HTML;`, never `HTML,`. Closure `use ($a, $b)` needs the closing `)` before `{`.

```bash
docker exec mollerweb3_web php -l /var/www/html/path/to/file.php
```
